{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the bullets! Strike to the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MoriyaRhythm is a Touhou Project fan game that fuses bullet hell and rhythm action into one colorful experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pop and Cute!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable characters, dazzling danmaku, and upbeat music\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enjoy them all at once!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hit to the Beat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is everything in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen closely to the music and feel the rhythm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge the Danmaku!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in the original series, waves of beautiful bullets will come your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between big and small jumps to weave through the patterns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Try, Fun to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage lasts only a few dozen seconds,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so you can practice and retry as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re skilled at both rhythm and danmaku,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aim for no damage and full combo runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfaction guaranteed!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127490?t=1762091710","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127490?t=1762091710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127490/24b8ee44590c12ad881e86e131a99fa3bc9ed821/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762091710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127490/24b8ee44590c12ad881e86e131a99fa3bc9ed821/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762091710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the bullets! Strike to the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MoriyaRhythm is a Touhou Project fan game that fuses bullet hell and rhythm action into one colorful experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pop and Cute!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable characters, dazzling danmaku, and upbeat music\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enjoy them all at once!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hit to the Beat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is everything in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen closely to the music and feel the rhythm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge the Danmaku!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in the original series, waves of beautiful bullets will come your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between big and small jumps to weave through the patterns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Try, Fun to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage lasts only a few dozen seconds,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so you can practice and retry as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re skilled at both rhythm and danmaku,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aim for no damage and full combo runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfaction guaranteed!</p>","developers":["FriendNavy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127490/a1ba5659d8f43bf7a1a7a24d343e26f1af04adcb/header.jpg?t=1762091710","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min